{% assign Title = "Load #" | append: LoadNumber | append: " delivered" %}
{% assign Sender = CompanyName %}
{% assign Preheader = "Delivered in " | append: DestinationCity | append: " on " | append: DeliveredAt | append: ". Your eBOL is ready." %}
<h1 class="h1 t-ink" style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; color: #18181b;">Your vehicles were delivered</h1>

<p class="t-body" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3f3f46;">
  {{ CompanyName }} delivered load #{{ LoadNumber }}{% if LoadName %} ({{ LoadName }}){% endif %}
  in {{ DestinationCity }} on {{ DeliveredAt }}{% if ReceiverName %}, signed for by {{ ReceiverName }}{% endif %}.
</p>

<table role="presentation" class="c-panel" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 24px 0 0; background-color: #f4f4f5; border-radius: 8px;">
  <tr>
    <td class="panel-cell" style="padding: 20px;">
      <p class="t-muted" style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #71717a;">Vehicles</p>
      {% for vehicle in Vehicles %}
      <p class="t-ink" style="margin: 0{% unless forloop.last %} 0 6px{% endunless %}; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b;">{{ vehicle }}</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p class="t-body" style="margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3f3f46;">
  The electronic bill of lading is in the customer portal. It records each vehicle's condition at pickup and delivery, with both signatures.
</p>

<table role="presentation" class="btn" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 28px 0 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="border-radius: 8px; background-color: #18181b;">
      <a href="{{ ShipmentUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px;">View shipment and eBOL</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
